---

The number formatting, progress-bar geometry, and panel layout in this package
are reimplementations of behaviour in OpenAI's Codex
(https://github.com/openai/codex), which is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The specific functions and their source locations are named in the
doc comments of `src/shared/format.ts` and `src/client/panel.tsx`. No Codex
source code is copied or redistributed here; only the observable formatting
rules were reproduced.
